  "energy_arc": "Intro: Somber, atmospheric alaap establishing the dark midnight weight of Darbari over the D drone.\nMukhada: Heavy doom groove drops in with crushing palm-muted guitars anchoring the sitar theme.\nBreakdown: Utter rhythmic crush, stripping the lead for low-octave downtuned chugs and kick syncopation.\nMukhada: Resurgent melodic hook returning with full rhythm section power.\nTaan Long: Sitar peaks at maximum virtuosic intensity with orchestral brass and strings driving the climax.\nTihai: Threefold cadential figure locking drums and sitar into a hammerblow sam.\nOutro: Sustained low D power chord ringing out into cavernous reverb and silence."
